WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
This is what $1.18 million gets you.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
Just not in Vancouver or Toronto.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
Inner-city Calgary, where space isn't a luxury, it's stiff.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
Open concept living that actually feels open.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.000
Natural light in every corner.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.000
Clean, modern design without the trade-off.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
You're minutes from downtown, but it feels like a completely different place.

00:25.000 --> 00:29.000
In Vancouver or Toronto, $1.18 million buys you compromise.

00:29.000 --> 00:31.000
Here, it buys you control.

00:32.000 --> 00:35.000
More space, more privacy, more homes.

00:35.000 --> 00:37.000
Same budget, different life.

00:42.000 --> 00:45.000
If you've been thinking about making a move, this is your sign.

00:45.000 --> 00:47.000
And it might be time.

00:47.000 --> 00:49.000
Calgary isn't the backup plan.

00:49.000 --> 00:51.000
It's the upgrade.

